        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Takahiro Moriuchi, Doug Pinnick, Toru Yamashita, Ryota Kohama, Tomoya Kanki\n- Organizations: ONE OK ROCK, King's X\n- Roles: lead vocalist, co-lead vocalist, bass guitarist, songwriter, guitarist, leader, bassist, drummer\n\nFacts:\n- Doug Pinnick was born on September 3, 1950.\n- Takahiro Moriuchi was born on April 17, 1988 in Tokyo.\n- Doug Pinnick is an American musician also styled as dUg Pinnick or simply dUg.\n- Doug Pinnick is best known as the bass guitarist, songwriter, and co-lead vocalist for the hard rock/progressive metal band King's X.\n- Takahiro Moriuchi is known professionally as Taka.\n- Takahiro Moriuchi is the lead vocalist of the Japanese rock band ONE OK ROCK.\n- ONE OK ROCK currently consists of Takahiro Moriuchi on vocals, Toru Yamashita on guitar and as leader, Ryota Kohama on bass, and Tomoya Kanki on drums.",
